{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015509_7001e738","chunk_index":4,"job_id":"mwjob_8447f85a17afe47f1dddc26c","precondition_digest":"7349d025237003fc2a71649e47dc3f181ea6e6f1b327c41c9a0c64a4929460d8","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v6","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b7de17e9668663cc","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_57a2ea891245f09c","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_a72266096758d298","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_818d6b6aa87464a2"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015509_7001e738","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:33fd3b1c564e3726e0462a03","quote":"当前正文=随机化（随机分配）；双盲；安慰剂对照（匹配安慰剂）；平行组（parallel assignment）；多中心","quote_sha256":"20ace8cee8650e8264f10d4d3509afecb32d21820d4669c8231f7303fecb2814","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:33fd3b1c564e3726e0462a03","span_id":"ev_sel_4_1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究分期：III期","quote_sha256":"5ac919b18530a35e6df200dbf04b4bc9fbd8d00da2c279aa58a1ff849584b451","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_phase"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"内在研究目的：确证性研究","quote_sha256":"9910bf06ee75c8853c143b11ec7df385f95306b1d5f76e729515dd9609db0a9c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_purpose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机","quote_sha256":"671a62a354113705569b311f82cdff13e6dc35ab5faac84b8993f18ac7fe7ebc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_overall"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_center"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"目标研究人群：成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者","quote_sha256":"a1f2b59730f1d08cde8f6a85d4179e62887b3729f4175c98334b9dafda33e808","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_population"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"3e9ca06af65f6aeb7e28df97f2a93f40d8966553fa5faff3f806e43f762999dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照：匹配安慰剂对照；试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。","quote_sha256":"bcf69f1343deaa3b4cd6b8ab0fd4fbac84bf974c3118292b17999b1ba93aa172","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_control"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_primary_endpoint"}],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_sel_4_1","ev_sd_phase","ev_sd_purpose","ev_sd_overall","ev_sd_center","ev_sd_population","ev_sd_inclusion","ev_sd_intervention","ev_sd_control","ev_sd_periods","ev_sd_visits","ev_sd_primary_endpoint"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":11},"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的III期确证性临床研究，采用多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照的平行组设计。研究人群为确诊为斑块状银屑病且疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者，入选要求包括年龄≥18岁、确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月，以及筛选和基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3。受试者按1:1随机分配至试验组或对照组，试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服、每日一次，对照组接受匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗期均为16周。研究设置筛选期最长4周、双盲治疗期16周和安全性随访期4周；筛选后于基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访，PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。研究以第16周达到PASI 75应答的受试者比例作为主要疗效评价指标。","rationale":"依据已确认的III期确证性研究定位、中国开发区域、成人中重度斑块状银屑病人群、多中心随机双盲安慰剂对照平行组设计、合成试验药A 100 mg口服每日一次连续16周、匹配安慰剂、1:1随机、筛选期最长4周/双盲治疗期16周/安全性随访4周及访视安排撰写。医学作者需核对总体设计描述与后续章节在访视、终点和干预表述上的一致性。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（总体设计），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_b7de17e9668663cc","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:33fd3b1c564e3726e0462a03","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015509_7001e738","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"确证性设计与假设依据","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"依据已确认的主要目的、主要终点、关键次要终点、其他次要终点、安全性终点、样本量假设（试验组60%、安慰剂组30%、双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机、15%脱落、132例且每组66例）、CMH分析、无应答填补、多重插补和观察病例敏感性分析、安全性集按实际治疗分析以及不开展期中分析和样本量再估计等事实撰写。医学作者需核对假设依据、估计目标策略和检验水准表述是否与统计分析计划一致。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（确证性设计与假设依据），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_57a2ea891245f09c","section_number":"4.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:33fd3b1c564e3726e0462a03","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015509_7001e738","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:33fd3b1c564e3726e0462a03","quote":"当前正文=采用随机化分配。随机分配","quote_sha256":"2f7f71fac428b63af7f62381d375fc8ec7f4a1698f2b63b71fb2e749134656c1","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:33fd3b1c564e3726e0462a03","span_id":"ev_sel_4_3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"随机化方式：随机分配","quote_sha256":"a0b434e0929aba98b91027a87aab6b9dc58df4c52aeb8d9e9de686bf28f2cd5a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_randomization"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照：匹配安慰剂对照；试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。","quote_sha256":"bcf69f1343deaa3b4cd6b8ab0fd4fbac84bf974c3118292b17999b1ba93aa172","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_control"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"ev_sd_stats"}],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_sel_4_3","ev_sd_randomization","ev_sd_control","ev_sd_visits","ev_sd_stats"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"随机化","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化分配。受试者在基线/第1天按1:1的比例随机分配至合成试验药A组或匹配安慰剂组，进入为期16周的双盲治疗期。随机化通过机会分配降低选择偏倚，使两组受试者在已知和未知基线特征上尽可能均衡，为合成试验药A相较安慰剂的确证性比较提供基础。随机分配与双盲设计相结合，以控制实施偏倚和评价偏倚。随机分组信息将用于全分析集按随机分组的疗效比较。","rationale":"依据已确认的随机分配方式、1:1随机、基线/第1天随机时点、16周双盲治疗期和全分析集按随机分组分析等事实撰写。医学作者需核对随机化的实施细节（如随机化系统、分层因素与区组设置）是否已有项目文件支持，并在随机化章节定稿前确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（随机化），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_a72266096758d298","section_number":"4.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:33fd3b1c564e3726e0462a03","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015509_7001e738","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"盲法与揭盲","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"依据已确认的双盲设计、匹配安慰剂、1:1随机分配及16周双盲治疗期撰写；正文仅对盲态维持和揭盲原则作保守表述，未指定任何系统、时限、角色分工或揭盲后处理。医学作者需确认揭盲适用情形、操作流程、记录要求及紧急揭盲后的受试者处理等决策，并核实匹配安慰剂与试验药物在包装和外观上的一致性要求。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（盲法与揭盲），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_818d6b6aa87464a2","section_number":"4.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:33fd3b1c564e3726e0462a03","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:c3e1f164c2e657","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:33fd3b1c564e3726e0462a03","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:33fd3b1c564e3726e0462a03","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"4292e9084e95c88